        <mxCell id="BWiyRp8-Lt3Y1AErPo7j-12" value="&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Teachflow Extension is enabled&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Fetch Readme.md from the github repo link from youtube video description&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Display it below youtube video&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Run the commands from README.md in parallel with the video through websocket&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;prereqs : README.md should be modified to contain time to exectute or this info should be in some database from where the extension fecthes if it is just execution , if inserting then name and structure of the file should be in README.md or database&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;gradientColor=#ffd966;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
